{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../ChatPermissions/", "title": "ChatPermissions"}, "next": {"link": "../ChatPrivileges/", "title": "ChatPrivileges"}, "title": "ChatPhoto", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"chatphoto\">\n<h1>ChatPhoto<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#chatphoto\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.ChatPhoto\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatPhoto</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChatPhoto\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>A chat photo.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>small_file_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 File identifier of small (160x160) chat photo.\nThis file_id can be used only for photo download and only for as long as the photo is not changed.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>small_photo_unique_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Unique file identifier of small (160x160) chat photo, which is supposed to be the same over time and for\ndifferent accounts. Can\u2019t be used to download or reuse the file.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>big_file_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 File identifier of big (640x640) chat photo.\nThis file_id can be used only for photo download and only for as long as the photo is not changed.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>big_photo_unique_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Unique file identifier of big (640x640) chat photo, which is supposed to be the same over time and for\ndifferent accounts. Can\u2019t be used to download or reuse the file.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>has_animation</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>) \u2013 True, if the photo has animated variant</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>is_personal</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>) \u2013 True, if the photo is visible only for the current user</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>minithumbnail</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StrippedThumbnail/#pyrogram.types.StrippedThumbnail\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StrippedThumbnail\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StrippedThumbnail</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 User profile photo minithumbnail; may be None.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/ChatPrivileges", "ChatPrivileges", "N", "next"], ["api/types/ChatPermissions", "ChatPermissions", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">ChatPhoto</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChatPhoto\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatPhoto</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/types/ChatPhoto", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}